345. ## Key User Journeys (for QA reference)
346. 
347. ### 1. Search & Browse Flow
348. ```
349. Customer → Akamai → Kong (S&B) → Presentation Shell
350.   → [Module Federation loads Search MFE]
351.   → Search MFE calls BFF: GET /api/search/v1/accommodation
352.   → BFF → TravelBox (hotel offers)
353.   → BFF → NDC Connector → Amadeus (flight prices)
354.   → BFF → Valkey (cache result)
355.   ← Returns combined hotel+flight offers to UI
356. ```
357. 
358. ### 2. Checkout & Booking Flow
359. ```
360. Customer selects offer → Shell calls Kong (C&P) → Checkout Backend
361.   → Checkout → TravelBox (lock offer / create cart)
362.   → Checkout → Avios (price in points, if applicable)
363.   → Customer submits payment → Checkout → Payments Orchestrator
364.     → Orchestrator → PCI Proxy (tokenise card)
365.     → Orchestrator → CyberSource (authorise & capture)
366.     [or → Orchestrator → Avios (redeem points)]
367.   ← Payment success → Checkout → TravelBox (confirm booking)
368.   → Checkout → Flight Orders Adapter → IAGL EI (create flight order)
369.   ← Booking reference returned to customer
370. ```
371. 
372. ### 3. Supplier Payment Flow (post-booking, internal)
373. ```
374. Booking confirmed → FSI reads DynamoDB (booking record)
375.   → FSI → Aurora PostgreSQL (financial transaction)
376.   → DSPI → AMEX (create Virtual Credit Card for hotel supplier)
377.   → DSPI → Aurora PostgreSQL (store VCC data)
378. ```
